      "argument_summary": "Applicant amended claim 1 to recite a 'toroidally wound magnet' and argues MIT teaches only different tape widths between pancakes (axially in the stack) and does not teach varying tape width within a single pancake (radially). Applicant contends MIT teaches away from intra-pancake width variation and therefore cannot anticipate claim 1.",
