      "rationale": "Tamura (the cited prior art in O1) discloses a mobile station that: (a) establishes a short-range wireless link to a terminal device and (b) communicates with a base station so as to relay data communication. The Examiner interprets the claimed \"first communication module\" and \"second communication module\" as functional components (short-range interface and base-station interface) of a single electronic device (mobile station) taught by Tamura, and finds Tamura teaches obtaining/using a profile to effect communication over the base-station link via the short-range connection and storing profile-related data. Thus the references relied upon anticipate the recitations of independent apparatus Claim 1 and independent method Claim 11 as explained below.",
