          "doc_id": "IVI8GOYKRXEAPX5",
          "support_span": "Then, the mobile station 2 (server) and the terminal device 3 (client) perform processing of transmission/reception of a data service connection request S37, transmission/reception of a response signal S38 and a session establishment S39 based on the Bluetooth standard procedure, thereby achieving the data communication in the BWC.",
