      "status": "maintained",
      "rationale": "Tamura's disclosure that the mobile station restarts/resumes data communication with the base station via the short-range-connected terminal is read to teach outputting information regarding provisioning/communication-state and the presence or absence of relevant profile information to the external device, as those functions are inherent in the disclosed signaling and session control.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "doc_id": "IVI8GOYKRXEAPX5",
