      "rationale": "A provisional nonstatutory double-patenting rejection was made in the July 29, 2016 Office action over claims of copending Application No. 14/838,438. Applicant indicates in the October 31, 2016 remarks that a terminal disclaimer is being filed to overcome the rejection. A terminal disclaimer document is not of record in the file wrapper provided to the examiner at cutoff; therefore the double-patenting provisional rejection remains outstanding until a proper terminal disclaimer is of record or other resolution is shown.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "doc_id": "IR4WGVTCRXEAPX1",
          "support_span": "Claims 1, 6, 7, 12 and 13 are provisionally rejected on the ground of nonstatutory double patenting as being unpatentable over claims 1, 8, 9, 10, 12 and 14 of copending Application No. 14/838438.",
