      "status": "new",
      "rationale": "Applicant amended independent claim 1 to add a filament limitation. The amendment is supported by the specification and was timely filed on the A1 cutoff date. The prior rejection under 35 U.S.C. 103 relied on Blake, which the Office action did not cite as disclosing filaments coupled to the haptic plate extending from the periphery. Because the amendment introduces a limitation that is not shown in the original rejection record against Blake, the previous 103 rejection as to claim 1 is withdrawn contingent upon entry of the amendment.",
