      "rationale": "Claims 2-6 and 8-9 depend from claim 1. Applicant's amendment to claim 1 (adding filament) is entered; the dependency chain is updated. The prior 103 rejections that addressed these dependent claims were based on Blake. Because Blake as applied in the earlier Office action did not show filaments coupled to the haptic plate extending from the periphery, and because the amendment to claim 1 introduces that limitation, the earlier 103 rejections against these dependent claims are withdrawn contingent on entry of the amended claim 1. The claims are otherwise allowable if no other prior art or issues are present.",
