          "support_span": "Maltsev teaches according to a frame structure, a modulation mode and a rate (Maltsev [0019] lines 7-11, [0020] lines 1-8, a frame structure is used for communication between sending and receiving station. data rate on the sub carrier depends on modulation scheme selected)",
