      "status": "maintained",
      "rationale": "Applicant amended claims 1, 7, 16 and 19 to provide antecedent and definite claim language addressing the examiner’s prior 35 U.S.C. 112(b) concerns (change of \"upper portion\" to explicitly recite \"upper rail extension\" or rail-forming \"upper portion\" and added the pair of side members/defined opening language). The previously-issued 112(b) rejection for claims 1, 2, 6, 8 and 9 was based on lack of antecedent basis; Applicant’s amendment supplies the missing antecedent and clarifies the claim scope.",
