          "support_span": "Claims 3 and 10-16 are rejected under pre-AIA 35 U.S.C. 103(a) as being unpatentable over Walter (U.S Patent 6,348,101 B1) in view of Hayes (U.S Patent 5,716,457) and Donnelly et al. (U.S Patent 6,159,345) and Tonkovich (PG Pub 20060016215).",
