          "support_span": "Walter teaches a method for continuously separating contaminants from rinse solvent in a system for cleaning electronic and other components comprising (col 2 lines 1-35, col 3 lines 3-6): treating a contaminated substrate that has been subjected to treatment with a solvating agent with a rinsing solvent ... and removing contaminated rinsing solvent from said rinse tank (col 10 lines 10-55).",
