          "support_span": "Donnelly teaches a method that utilizes distillation (col 3 lines 35-40) for recovering and recycling solvents ...",
          "source_scope": "record_text"
        },
        {
          "doc_id": "HTR7LS2ZPXXIFW4",
          "support_span": "Tonkovich teaches that it is well known to use a micro-still for a distillation process for separating fluids (abstract and para 0051) and for withdrawing a bottoms product from the system (para 0052).",
