      ],
      "status": "maintained",
      "rationale": "The combination of Chung (teaching concept extraction, concept hierarchies, and user interfaces for editing/manipulating concepts) with Tran (teaching an IP/patent server, presenting search results and permitting users to select, annotate, rate or delete patents from result sets) provides the skilled artisan with a reasoned basis to (1) assemble a concept/patent pool derived from patent documents and (2) narrow a patent result set by user designations (including removing patents when concepts mapped to all claims are designated irrelevant). The claimed steps of receiving input designating concepts as irrelevant and removing patents mapped only to those concepts are taught or suggested by the cited combination.",
