          "doc_id": "IN64MD6MPXXIFW4",
          "support_span": "Claim 1 is rejected under pre-AIA 35 U.S.C. 103(a) as being unpatentable over Chung et al. (20030217335, hereinafter as Chung) in view of Tran et al. (20050210008, hereinafter as Tran).",
