d the examiner similarly cannot yet find allowance of the proposed claim set because it has not been entered. If applicant believes the amendments should be entered despite any outstanding formalities, state the basis and identify the specific supporting portions of the specification (page/paragraph or figure reference) for each newly-added limitation so the examiner can determine whether the amendment complies with the statutes and rules for entry.",
