      "argument_summary": "Applicant argues Yamaguchi does not disclose \"a plurality of individual detection units corresponding to movement directions of the object,\" and therefore does not anticipate claim 1. Applicant cites Yamaguchi paragraphs [0329]-[0335] and contends the cited art fails to show plurality corresponding to movement directions.",
