      "rationale": "The pending claims are rejected as anticipated by the prior art reference identified in the Office action (Yagishita). The Office action indicates Yagishita discloses the claimed phosphoric acid ester metal salt (formula (1)), a sulfur-containing organic molybdenum compound, and an ashless dispersant; and specifically provides example compositions in which a molybdenum-containing compound having a Mo:S relationship close to or within the claimed range is present.",
